# TANTRA Platform Capability SDK

Official SDK for external participants integrating with the TANTRA Secure Federated Capability Fabric.

## Installation

### From GitHub (recommended)
```bash
pip install git+https://github.com/PriteshPatra-BHIV/QCG_task1.git#subdirectory=sdk
```

### Editable / development mode
```bash
git clone https://github.com/PriteshPatra-BHIV/QCG_task1.git
cd QCG_task1/sdk
pip install -e .
```

## Quick Start

```python
from tantra_platform_sdk import PlatformCapabilitySDK

sdk = PlatformCapabilitySDK(
    discovery_urls=["https://bhiv-qcg.onrender.com"],
    service_id="MY-SERVICE-001"
)

# Discover registered services
services = sdk.discover_services()

# Negotiate version compatibility
neg = sdk.negotiate_version("TANTRA-PSR-USF-001", "1.0.0")
print(neg.status)  # COMPATIBLE | DEPRECATED | UNSUPPORTED

# Invoke a capability
result = sdk.invoke_capability(
    service_id="TANTRA-PSR-USF-001",
    operation="discover_solvers",
    payload={"problem_type": "QUBO"}
)
print(result.status)      # SUCCESS
print(result.evidence)    # hash-chained invocation proof
```

## What's Included

| Module | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `tantra_platform_sdk.sdk` | Core `PlatformCapabilitySDK` class |
| `tantra_platform_sdk.models` | `InvocationResult`, `NegotiationResult`, `InvocationEvidence`, etc. |
| `tantra_platform_sdk.auth` | `SDKAuthenticator` — request signing & response verification |
| `tantra_platform_sdk.trust` | `TrustProvider` interface (Classical / PostQuantum / Hybrid) |

## Dependencies

- `cryptography >= 42.0.0`
- Python >= 3.10 (stdlib only otherwise)

## Environment Variables

| Variable | Default | Purpose |
|----------|---------|---------|
| `QCG_MOCK_SDK` | `0` | Set to `1` for offline testing without live endpoints |

